# The build context is the repository root, because the runtime image installs
# the census2-store package. Everything a build does not read stays out of it:
# a Nextflow work directory alone is larger than the whole image.
.git
.github
**/.nf-test
**/.nf-test.log
**/nf-test
**/work
**/out
**/reports
**/.nextflow
**/.nextflow.log*
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/build
**/.venv
*.zip
*.jsonl
